msgctxt "#30112"
msgid "Direct Tuner Recorder is a separate program for an always-on computer. It records even when Kodi is closed, and every Kodi in the house shares its timers, recordings and tuners. Without it, recordings run only while this Kodi is open and the settings below apply."
